  "why": "What fm-capm reads to see whether a manager has fixed or exposed the MVO robots' penalty. Without it nothing holds the three parsers to the manifest's default spelled 'default' (not defaultValue), to a null 'required' read as false, to a parameter group the manifest leaves out read as empty rather than null, to a fixed parameter's absent control read as null, and to a control's decimals read as decimals -- a penalty range 0.001-0.009 read as integers is 0-0 and refuses every study penalty.",
