    "constructed": "GET /v1/marketplaces/{marketplaceId}/robots asks the robot host for its catalogue, and the local fm-robots-server did not answer on 2026-10-09. Modelled on fm-server's MarketplaceRobotHandler.MarketplaceRobotView, RobotManifest.RobotParameter and MarketplaceRobotConfig (whose isExposed() serialises as 'exposed'), with the field set checked against fm-server's contract/wire-manifest.json."
  },
